    objective: 'Get rid of all cards. Last with cards = Durak (Fool).',
    gameplay: '1. Attacker (left of dealer first) plays 1, 3, or 5 cards: single; pair+any; two pairs+any or four+any. 2. Defender beats each with higher same suit or trump. 3. All beaten: discard; defender becomes attacker. Some beaten: unbeaten to defender; attacker = left of defender. None beaten: defender takes all; attacker = left of defender. 4. Draw to 5 until stock empty. 5. Cannot attack with more cards than defender holds. 6. Trump 6 â†” face-up trump. 7. Draw possible if 2 left, equal cards, all beaten.',
